# Updater signing key - NEVER commit this. Losing it means you can never
# sign a new update again; leaking it means anyone could sign a fake one.
# The matching .pub file is fine to commit (it's not a secret).
forscribe-updater.key
UPDATER_KEY_PASSWORD.txt

